    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You walk the lucid corridor between sparks.</em></p><p>Once per <strong>a Soma Break</strong>, as an <strong>action</strong>, you may open the <strong>Blue Meridian</strong> for <strong>1 minute</strong>:</p><ul><li>You may <strong>teleport up to 6 squares</strong> as part of any movement or bonus action.</li><li>You may teleport to any <strong>Gate Anchor</strong> you have placed within <strong>60 squares</strong>, provided the path does not cross solid barriers (doors are fine; walls are not).</li><li>Allies within 2 squares of a Gate Anchor you teleport to may also teleport to that Anchor as a reaction (once each per activation).</li><li>Whenever you teleport, you gain <strong>advantage</strong> on the next defense check you make before the end of your next turn.</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic Echo.</strong> If the Blue Meridian is used during a Spark Step or metaphysical crisis to reposition the party into a stabilizing or protective configuration, reduce an appropriate <strong>Darkness Track</strong> by <strong>1</strong>.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"dwSapphireMerid\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Blue Meridian</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break (1-min stance) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Action (open) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Open the Meridian for 1 minute: teleport up to 6 squares as movement/bonus action, jump to any Gate Anchor within 60 squares (no solid barriers crossed), allies within 2 squares of that Anchor may follow as a reaction. Each teleport reroll the lowest die on your next defense check before end of next turn. Strategic Echo: if used to stabilize a Spark Step / metaphysical crisis, reduce a relevant Darkness Track by 1.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
